  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical Support to Public Services in Belgium for the Welcoming and Integration of Persons Displaced by the Crisis in Ukraine</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to provide technical support to two public services in Belgium to improve the capacity, coordination and implementation of actions implemented by the public services and the various stakeholders on local, regional and national level related to the welcoming and integration of displaced people from Ukraine in the context of the Russian invasion of Ukraine.</narrative>
  </description>
